WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Upbeat instrumental] Big trips. Little people. SproutRoute.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Meet SproutRoute. A family trip planner. The real desktop input screen appears.

00:09.000 --> 00:17.000
A fictional family requests two days in Las Vegas with a six-year-old. Demo UI, edited for pace.

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
The itinerary shows suggested activities and times. Check venue details before traveling.

00:26.000 --> 00:34.000
Tiny travelers. Many things. Packing checklist items are checked off. Illustrative weather.

00:34.000 --> 00:41.000
Travel guidance appears alongside the plan. Verify current local requirements.

00:41.000 --> 00:48.000
Small screen. Big adventure. Actual responsive mobile-browser itinerary and packing screens.

00:48.000 --> 00:55.000
Eleven models screened, three tuned finalists. Ten of ten synthetic recovery runs passed structure checks. Not a production reliability or venue-accuracy claim.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
Go make a little adventure. sproutroute.app. Code and evals: github.com/prasadnitish/SproutRoute.
